{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026TOzqiVT3pr1792968806.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>天齊鋰業截至九月底止第三季度按年多賺13倍，純利接近13.6億元人民幣。扣除非經常性損益純利13.33億元人民幣，增長18倍，主要受新能源產業發展與下游需求增長等多重利好因素驅動。</p><p></p><p>期內收入超過60億元人民幣，增長1.3倍。主要受鋰產品的銷售均價，以及鋰化合物和衍生品的銷量均按年上升所致。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T06:20:46.662944+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":145,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T22:46:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T18:18:07.619316+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T06:18:10.712998+00:00","content_hash":"82ecbd3a287fe580acf5a822dc3dd4c7d71953a9e88455f52a8076028db53400","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T06:20:46.662944+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}